=== GIAI DAP LY THUYET CHUYEN SAU: BOUNDED MODEL CHECKING & MO HINH BO NHO ===

1. NGUYEN LY HOAT DONG CUA BOUNDED MODEL CHECKING (BMC):
   - BMC bien doi bai toan kiem tra mo hinh (Model Checking) tren do thi trang thai vo han thanh
     bai toan kiem tra tinh thoa man menh de (SAT/SMT) tren mot do sau gioi han k.
   - Ba buoc xu ly cot loi:
     (1) Mo cuon vong lap (Loop Unwinding): Thay the vong lap while/for bang k khoi lenh tuan tu if-else.
     (2) Chuyen doi sang dang SSA (Static Single Assignment): Moi bien duoc gan gia tri moi tai moi buoc
         duoc gan mot phien ban bien moi (x_0, x_1, ..., x_k).
     (3) Ma hoa SMT: Sinh cong thuc Phi = Init(s_0) AND And_{i=0}^{k-1} Trans(s_i, s_{i+1}) AND Or_{i=0}^k Not(Prop(s_i)).
   - Neu Phi la SAT: Solver tra ve mot duong di cu the dan toi trang thai vi pham (Counterexample / Witness).
   - Neu Phi la UNSAT: He thong khong co loi trong k buoc dau tien.

2. MO HINH BO NHO TRONG KIEM CHUNG (MEMORY MODELS):
   - Mo hinh khoang gia tri (Interval/Flat Memory Model): Dung trong dong co Lab 6 nay, mo hinh hoa mang bang
     khoang chi so hop le [0, array_size). Don gian, tinh toan cuc nhanh, rat tot cho kiem tra vuot bien mảng.
   - Mo hinh Z3 Array Theory (Select/Store): Mang duoc coi la mot ham toan hoc A: Index -> Value.
     + select(A, i) doc gia tri tai i.
     + store(A, i, v) tra ve mang moi voi gia tri tai i bang v.
     + Tuan theo tien de Read-over-Write cua McCarthy: select(store(A, i, v), j) = if (i=j) then v else select(A, j).
   - Mo hinh Byte-Level Memory Model (nhu CBMC): Bieu dien bo nho la mang byte khong lo, ho tro con tro
     ep kieu (type-punning), pointer arithmetic va struct padding.

3. SO SANH BMC VOI MODEL CHECKING CO DIEN (KRIPKE/SMV O LAB 1):
   - Kripke/NuSMV (Lab 1): Kiem tra an toan vo han (Unbounded Safety) tren toan bo khong gian trang thai reachable.
     Tuy nhien doi mat voi van de 'Bung no khong gian trang thai' (State Space Explosion) khi chuong trinh co bien so.
   - BMC (Lab 6): Tranh duoc bung no trang thai nho gioi han do sau k va dung SMT solver hien dai (Z3).
     Phat hien bug cuc nhanh, tao duoc exploit payload chinh xac, nhung khong chung minh duoc an toan tuyet doi.
